1
00:00:00,143 --> 00:00:02,543
(Amy:)...they devour their mate.

2
00:00:03,413 --> 00:00:04,503
(Sheldon:)Your point being?

3
00:00:12,088 --> 00:00:14,078
(Amy:)Dessert is served.

4
00:00:15,291 --> 00:00:17,661
(Sheldon:)I just had cobbler.

5
00:00:18,928 --> 00:00:20,488
(Amy:)You know what?

6
00:00:20,997 --> 00:00:22,487
(Amy:)I'm done with this.

7
00:00:24,067 --> 00:00:26,597
- But where are you going?
- I'm leaving.

8
00:00:26,836 --> 00:00:29,496
(Sheldon:)You can't leave, I need you.

9
00:00:32,842 --> 00:00:35,432
- You do?
- Yes.

10
00:00:35,812 --> 00:00:37,512
(Sheldon:)You're my ride.

11
00:00:39,849 --> 00:00:41,149
(Penny:)Sheldon...

12
00:00:41,317 --> 00:00:44,147
(Amy:)...you either say something meaningful
and from the heart...

13
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:45,720
(Amy:)...or you and I are done.

14
00:00:47,490 --> 00:00:48,820
(Penny:)All right.

15
00:00:50,793 --> 00:00:52,493
(Howard:)Please.

16
00:00:56,299 --> 00:00:59,019
(Scene:)Amy...

